// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/V_PvP_05_01/_src/V_PvP_05_01_NPCs.xls 	Sheet : DATA_Hero_Info 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P3367642550" "<em=lecture f=a>Hello, {HeroName}. We need your help in Recluse's Victory!<em none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2640921737" "<em=wave f=a>{HeroName}, we need heroes in Recluse's Victory! <em=none>"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2216506276" "<em=lecture f=a>We need strong heroes like you in Recluse's Victory, {HeroName}!<em=none>"
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P4171942613" "How did you get in here?!  Security!"
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P3996279824" "We need seasoned heroes with a Security Level of 40 and higher to go to Recluse's Victory and help keep it under Hero control.  If you think that you have what it takes, follow the lines to the Restricted Area elevator.  It'll take you down to the portal room.  On the other side, seek out the D.A.T.A. Orientation Adjutant in the Longbow Base.  He'll get you started.  <br><br>For an update on the battlefield as it currently stands, go see the D.A.T.A. Situation Monitor across the room.  He keeps heroes updated on our status via a direct link to the Operations Map in the Longbow base. <br><br>Make no mistake; it's a warzone and you will be attacked there. <br><br>  Good luck, {HeroName}!  We're all counting on you."
// Script Variable OutLoudInfoText :
"P3539206190" "<em=armscrossed><em=none>"
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Script Variable LevelRestrictedGreeting :
"P1579326548" "Sorry, {HeroName}, your Security Level isn't high enough yet to take on this assignment."
// Script Variable LevelRestrictedGreeting :
"P3347485601" "I wish you could help us, {HeroName}, but you are not yet strong enough for Recluse's Victory."
// Script Variable LevelRestrictedText :
"P3044958721" "I appreciate your enthusiasm, {HeroName}, but you need to be level 40 or higher to take on the villains in Recluse's Victory.  We need as many heroes as we can get to keep this situation under control, so please come back you're strong enough.<br><br>In the meantime, go see the D.A.T.A. Situation Monitor.  He will update you on the battle as it currently stands."
// Script Variable LevelRestrictedText :
"P1653518738" "You're not there yet, {HeroName}.  When your Security Level reaches 40, come back to me so that you can find out more about Recluse's Victory and how you can help your fellow heroes.  If any of your colleagues are at least level 40, tell them that Statesman and the Freedom Phalanx need their help.  <br><br>In the meantime, go see the D.A.T.A. Situation Monitor to find out the current situation in Recluse's Victory."
// DisplayName for N_Scientist :
"P2817651493" "D.A.T.A. Technician"

