// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : scripts/SpawnDefs/V_PvP_05_01/_src/V_PvP_05_01_NPCs.xls 	Sheet : RV_Hero_Welcome_Info 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 31 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1346930876" "Ah good, {HeroName}.  Thanks for coming."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2106041499" "Ah, good, {HeroName}.  You're here.  Let's get started."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P4083749939" "The battle is about to begin, {HeroName}.   You up for it?"
// Script Variable RestrictedText :
"P248579299" "You are NOT in the database, Villain!  Security!"
// Script Variable InfoText :
"P2804705513" "Greetings, {HeroName}.  Glad to see you teleported here in one piece.  <br><br>You are currently in a secure Freedom Corps base below Atlas Park, or at least what is left of it.  Above you, the city is in a constant Time Flux.  It will be Heroes like you that will make a very real difference in our future.  Literally!<br><br>Recluse has insinuated his way into this time continuum and has forced some captured D.A.T.A. scientists to make Temporal Anchors that will change the entire city.  The scientists were clever enough to build security systems on the pillboxes so that they could not be used so easily by Arachnos.  That is where you come in!<br><br>Before you join the battle topside, make sure that you are debriefed on the full situation.  Go see <color yellow>Commander Murat</color>.  You will find him in the center of the next chamber standing near the Operations map."
// Script Variable Leave :
// DisplayName for N_Scientist :
"P2963639243" "D.A.T.A. Orientation Adjutant"

